The screenshot shows:

Plain Text
Unable to listen on port 3000
bind: address already in use

This means something is already using port 3000 (likely your React app).

Find what's using port 3000

Run:

Shell
sudo lsof -i :3000

or

Shell
sudo netstat -tulpn | grep 3000

Example output:

Plain Text
COMMAND PID
node 12345
Kill the process
Shell
kill -9 12345

Or directly:

Shell
sudo fuser -k 3000/tcp
Easier Option: Use another port

Instead of 3000, forward Grafana to 3001:
